            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 60,
              "start": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Chatman, petitioner notes that the capital\u2011case presumption has been changed from 90 days to 180 days, affecting the timeliness of habeas petitions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Chatman",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6b04c4f137986662247c0f61f1282b87dd473a0dfaef47f676ba175a7ee5e3f3",
